"The true Elva died falling from a Direwing, and Jessica, an Earth girl, woke in her body."
"Jessica was sixteen when a meteor killed her on Earth, in weeks of meteor deaths."
"Jessica had been visiting family in Utah; her mother is dead, her father worked a refinery."
"Jessica's brother, three years older, left for army training before she died."
"Jessica can reach Elva's memories, but not easily."
"She fears the tribe would call her a Scaly Bastard imposter if the truth came out."
"She guessed from the names Ben and Jerry that Iris's strange sister is from Earth."
"She and Iris share a secret blood pact to kill Valrok."
"The Umarii Oracle judges her unlikely to ascend to godhood."
